WEBVTT

00:18.780 --> 00:20.870
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

01:29.980 --> 01:35.490
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

01:31.690 --> 01:35.490
Damn it, we're at the storm, 
but I can't see anything inside!

01:31.730 --> 01:35.490
<b>The Hero Weeps</b>

01:31.730 --> 01:35.490
<b>The Hero Weeps</b>

01:35.490 --> 01:38.730
You're not very useful, are you?

01:38.730 --> 01:41.990
You piss me off!
You piss me off <i>so much</i>.

01:42.720 --> 01:46.650
I wonder if Suzuno's already inside...

01:55.490 --> 01:56.510
That's weird.

01:57.010 --> 01:58.260
What?

01:58.860 --> 02:02.600
Libicocco's combat style doesn't 
exactly scream "Malebranche."

02:02.600 --> 02:03.980
He sucks too much.

02:03.980 --> 02:05.010
Huh?

02:05.010 --> 02:08.120
Even if he were fighting at full power,
 Bel could probably win.

02:08.120 --> 02:10.520
But not by as wide a margin.

02:10.830 --> 02:15.070
At this rate Bel will 
crush him, end of story.

02:15.070 --> 02:18.530
I don't get why <i>he'd</i> be here doing <i>this</i>.

02:19.230 --> 02:22.410
I don't like the fact that 
Emilia's not here, either.

02:23.350 --> 02:26.640
Did he say anything weird before we got here?

02:28.290 --> 02:31.060
It's Libicocco! Say it.

02:31.060 --> 02:32.910
L-Libikoko...

02:32.910 --> 02:33.750
I'll kill you!

02:34.980 --> 02:38.770
No, wrong weirdness... I remember 
he said he came to rampage.

02:38.770 --> 02:43.680
To rampage, eh? What exactly is 
he trying to distract us from?

02:53.630 --> 02:57.410
Hey, careful. You almost destroyed the roof.

02:57.410 --> 02:59.660
You'll die at this rate, you know.

03:00.290 --> 03:01.880
He's all talk and no action.

03:02.730 --> 03:08.260
You could fight more evenly with me 
if you dropped the wind spell.

03:08.260 --> 03:10.040
Why won't you?

03:11.580 --> 03:14.640
Clearly you have some other objective.

03:14.990 --> 03:18.090
But you need to release this school now.

03:18.540 --> 03:23.600
If you don't, I'll be forced 
to give you a death sentence.

03:23.600 --> 03:25.600
Go ahead.

03:28.640 --> 03:30.100
I've stopped that.

03:31.100 --> 03:35.000
If I kill you, it will be when 
I've determined beyond a doubt

03:35.000 --> 03:39.110
that you've brought evil upon 
people or the world.

03:39.900 --> 03:43.060
My time in Japan has taught me 
to be less rigid in my thinking.

03:43.060 --> 03:48.620
I've quit killing people just because 
they're demons or heretics.

03:48.620 --> 03:50.620
Miss Suzuno...

03:52.710 --> 03:57.380
You'll regret that attitude later, 
when everything is too late.

03:57.750 --> 04:02.580
I'd rather regret being betrayed 
than regret losing faith.

04:02.580 --> 04:07.370
And my comrades aren't so weak that 
they'd let themselves be too late.

04:07.970 --> 04:09.770
Isn't that right, good Chiho?

04:09.770 --> 04:13.340
Y-Yes, it is. You're right!

04:13.340 --> 04:14.910
Not sure I like the "comrades" part.

04:14.910 --> 04:18.020
So, what'll we do about this wind—

04:22.530 --> 04:24.660
Did you do something?

04:27.860 --> 04:30.930
I don't like this. What's about to happen?

04:38.290 --> 04:39.630
Lucifer!

04:39.630 --> 04:40.640
Shit!

04:41.190 --> 04:44.570
Bel, get Chiho Sasaki out of here. 
I can't hold out!

04:44.570 --> 04:46.470
Hold on, good Chiho!

04:56.210 --> 04:58.570
Miss Suzuno! Is he okay?!

04:58.570 --> 05:02.480
I can't tell. But if we go 
back there now, you'll burn.

05:06.490 --> 05:07.880
Look!

05:07.880 --> 05:11.800
I know. I'm going to drop you 
off in the schoolyard.

05:14.970 --> 05:15.750
No way...

05:21.690 --> 05:24.380
Step aside, Heavenly Regiment.

05:24.380 --> 05:26.880
Are they with Mister Gabriel?

05:27.230 --> 05:32.390
Gabriel's soldiers had less ornate attire.

05:32.390 --> 05:36.390
Are you lot aiding a demon faction?

05:38.820 --> 05:42.900
Archangel Chamuel! What are you plotting?!

05:47.910 --> 05:49.400
Mister Urushihara!

05:51.960 --> 05:53.150
Lucifer...

05:59.330 --> 06:02.670
Never thought you'd go along 
with a farce like this.

06:02.670 --> 06:05.700
What brought on the change of heart?

06:13.130 --> 06:14.680
Sorry, little bug.

06:15.060 --> 06:17.680
But hand it over. You know what I want!

06:20.980 --> 06:22.440
Argh!

06:22.440 --> 06:24.570
I've got no cell phone service!

06:25.620 --> 06:27.430
Wow, I messed up.

06:27.430 --> 06:30.460
I didn't think about any Japanese
civilians being here...

06:30.460 --> 06:31.700
Whatever shall I do?

06:33.450 --> 06:37.970
Look, I'm not into scaring girls.

06:37.970 --> 06:42.710
It would do me a solid if you'd believe that
 I don't particularly want to hurt you—

06:42.710 --> 06:44.690
S-Stay away!

06:44.690 --> 06:47.460
Help me... Help me, Mister Ashiya!

06:48.970 --> 06:52.620
Yeah, I guess this is coming off pretty bad...

06:52.620 --> 06:53.540
Ow!

06:53.970 --> 06:56.060
Hey, that hurts!

06:56.060 --> 06:58.660
Well, I guess I can't really 
make any excuses here.

06:58.660 --> 07:00.760
I'm sorry, okay?

07:00.760 --> 07:04.640
Feel free to cry or scream, but don't 
break down for a few more minutes.

07:04.640 --> 07:05.480
Hey!

07:07.460 --> 07:10.010
Hey, are you kidnapping them?

07:10.010 --> 07:12.500
We're doing nothing of the sort.

07:12.500 --> 07:15.240
We're just putting them back where they belong.

07:15.610 --> 07:16.880
What?

07:16.880 --> 07:19.500
Don't you worry about it.

07:19.500 --> 07:22.980
Please don't get the cops involved.
I mean, they won't catch us—

07:22.980 --> 07:23.750
Huh?

07:25.650 --> 07:28.000
Let go of Mister Ashiya, you jerk!

07:28.000 --> 07:32.010
H-Hey, miss, you're gonna rile 
them up! Stop, would you?

07:38.610 --> 07:39.520
Wait, don't!

07:42.010 --> 07:43.520
Yah!

07:49.780 --> 07:51.480
And who are you?

07:51.480 --> 07:53.520
How did you get in here?

07:53.520 --> 07:55.780
Who are you to ask me that?

07:56.350 --> 07:58.920
This is <i>my</i> turf.

07:59.890 --> 08:01.800
Anyone who messes with it dies.

08:01.800 --> 08:05.540
You're no exception, Mister Mysterious.

08:06.190 --> 08:08.030
Big talk.

08:08.030 --> 08:09.800
Who are you?

08:10.210 --> 08:14.440
I guess you could say 
I used to be Ashiya's employer.

08:17.450 --> 08:19.710
This is magic wind.

08:19.710 --> 08:24.140
And it looks like someone tore a hole 
in that part with celestial force.

08:24.140 --> 08:28.570
If we whack it again in the same spot,
 I bet it'd all crumble.

08:28.570 --> 08:32.730
But you can't do it, right, Maou? So I will.

08:32.730 --> 08:36.440
But Dad isn't here to be mistletoe...

08:36.440 --> 08:39.580
"Mistletoe"? Could I be that?

08:40.800 --> 08:46.290
I think so, but I kinda don't want you to.

08:46.290 --> 08:48.840
Like, I'm instinctively repulsed?

08:49.250 --> 08:51.130
You're seriously cruel.

08:51.690 --> 08:53.090
But it's possible, right?

08:55.700 --> 08:58.100
Please help me.

08:58.100 --> 09:01.130
In exchange, I promise to take care of you.

09:01.130 --> 09:05.520
Really? No man's ever 
said that to me before...

09:05.520 --> 09:06.900
Don't misinterpret me.

09:07.350 --> 09:10.370
Okay, Maou, come a little closer.

09:15.110 --> 09:17.050
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

09:17.050 --> 09:20.290
Bumping our foreheads together, what else?

09:33.800 --> 09:38.390
M-Maou... Maou, are you... Are you...

09:38.760 --> 09:40.640
the king of demons?!

09:41.300 --> 09:43.410
You should be over that by now.

09:43.410 --> 09:46.890
You just named yourself "Devil" with 
different kanji! Be more creative!

09:46.890 --> 09:48.750
Look who's talking.

09:50.350 --> 09:53.870
I can't believe I'm letting the ruler 
of demons have my body...

09:53.870 --> 09:57.790
I'm sorry, Mom. I'm a bad daughter.

09:57.790 --> 09:59.180
Your phrasing isn't funny.

10:04.730 --> 10:06.080
This is...

10:07.640 --> 10:11.500
just like when Alas Ramus 
comes out of Emi.

10:16.490 --> 10:19.190
Hand it over quietly.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.150
Don't do it.

10:24.150 --> 10:27.250
B-But Mister Urushihara...

10:27.250 --> 10:29.690
Do <i>not</i> under any circumstances
 give them the shard.

10:29.690 --> 10:34.190
Quit bluffing! 
You obviously can't do anything.

10:34.890 --> 10:38.940
I'll steal the shard from her 
and swallow it if I have to.

10:38.940 --> 10:43.700
Do you think a demon would 
hesitate to rip open a human?

10:43.700 --> 10:47.950
That sounds ten times better 
than just handing you the shard!

10:52.380 --> 10:53.880
Miss Suzuno!

10:55.310 --> 10:57.880
Don't worry. They didn't pierce me.

11:01.210 --> 11:02.680
How dare you!

11:03.790 --> 11:08.330
Miss Suzuno, put me down 
on the roof! I don't mind!

11:08.330 --> 11:10.890
It'll be easier for you to fight without me.

11:13.150 --> 11:15.650
Stay quiet or you'll bite your tongue!

11:16.070 --> 11:18.150
You're the one they're after!

11:19.830 --> 11:22.770
Damn it. Good Chiho, close your eyes.

11:22.770 --> 11:24.120
Blinding Flash!

11:25.910 --> 11:27.410
Out of my way!

11:31.180 --> 11:34.180
We're breaking out of here, good Chiho!

11:34.180 --> 11:35.170
Unfortunately...

11:36.590 --> 11:39.920
tricks like that don't work 
on the Malebranche.

11:46.970 --> 11:50.750
Miss Suzuno... Miss Suzuno!

11:53.070 --> 11:55.390
G-Good Chiho...

11:57.650 --> 12:03.500
Why defy them so? You're a Grand 
Hoshin churchwoman, aren't you?

12:04.640 --> 12:08.840
They are fellow servants 
of the God you worship.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.620
You gain nothing by going against them.

12:11.620 --> 12:17.240
They ally themselves with evil to 
hurt people and disrupt the world.

12:17.240 --> 12:19.630
They're no angels!

12:19.630 --> 12:20.970
Very well.

12:20.970 --> 12:26.890
I like warriors with backbone, 
but I can't compromise today.

12:28.130 --> 12:29.450
Listen, little bug.

12:30.700 --> 12:33.260
This is for your own good. Hand it over!

12:34.640 --> 12:38.020
Good Chiho... never hand it over...

12:38.020 --> 12:39.440
Miss Suzuno!

12:40.980 --> 12:44.700
I warned you. 
Don't blame me for what happens.

13:08.180 --> 13:09.430
Wh-What's that?!

13:17.300 --> 13:18.480
Mister Maou!

13:19.390 --> 13:22.830
Sorry I'm late. I was pretty far away.

13:22.830 --> 13:24.150
It's okay.

13:24.150 --> 13:25.370
You're not hurt?

13:25.370 --> 13:29.950
I'm fine. Miss Suzuno and 
Mister Urushihara protected me!

13:29.950 --> 13:34.150
You're very late, Satan.

13:34.150 --> 13:36.960
Hey, I got here before the clock ran out.
 Gimme a break.

13:38.220 --> 13:40.490
Hey, you alive?

13:40.490 --> 13:42.960
Still ticking—just barely.

13:43.680 --> 13:45.450
Give me a few more minutes.

13:45.450 --> 13:48.970
Thanks for holding out until 
I got here. Leave the rest to me.

13:52.110 --> 13:54.720
Anyway, I'm impressed with you guys.

13:55.450 --> 13:59.230
No one's taken down three 
of my generals since Emi.

13:59.230 --> 14:02.480
You son of a bitch! You cut off my arm!

14:02.970 --> 14:09.990
Bold of a mere Malebranche leader to 
take that tone with me, don't you think?

14:12.410 --> 14:16.000
That's not magic or celestial force.

14:16.520 --> 14:19.040
Just... pure power.

14:19.040 --> 14:26.260
So, are any of you as willing to risk 
their lives fighting me as Emi was?

14:32.220 --> 14:35.520
The sacred sword Better Half...?

14:38.380 --> 14:41.790
If you leave now, I'll let you go.

14:41.790 --> 14:42.770
But so you know...

14:44.050 --> 14:50.530
If outsiders make trouble on my turf, 
I'm obligated to do something about it.

14:51.720 --> 14:53.690
Okay. We'll go.

14:53.690 --> 14:56.540
Trying to fight you seems
 like a losing proposition.

14:56.890 --> 14:59.470
But do you mind if I take these two with me?

14:59.470 --> 15:03.120
Huh? W-Wait! Don't kidnap them!

15:03.120 --> 15:07.570
I told you, we're not kidnapping them. 
We're taking them home.

15:08.070 --> 15:09.550
Look, mind butting out of this?

15:10.020 --> 15:10.890
Go ahead.

15:10.890 --> 15:14.840
I can't interfere with that. It goes 
against the operating principles.

15:14.840 --> 15:17.060
Now you better not make trouble <i>here</i>.

15:17.480 --> 15:18.930
I'm grateful for that.

15:20.060 --> 15:22.450
No way. How can this be?!

15:24.470 --> 15:26.820
Wait. What's your name?

15:28.130 --> 15:33.120
Gabriel. Sometimes with the 
embarrassing title "Archangel."

15:33.120 --> 15:34.820
That <i>is</i> embarrassing.

15:34.820 --> 15:36.330
Mister Ashiya!

15:39.790 --> 15:42.080
What's...? Unhand me!

15:42.440 --> 15:43.580
Mister Ashiya!

15:43.580 --> 15:46.590
M-Miss Suzuki, I'm glad you're all right.

15:47.170 --> 15:50.450
Ms. Amane, please tell Maou...

15:53.600 --> 15:58.850
This isn't magic, so I'm guessing 
a rebound will come back to bite me.

15:59.830 --> 16:01.560
You Malebranche there.

16:02.090 --> 16:06.340
I'm sure you've got some conflicting 
duties here, but I don't care.

16:06.730 --> 16:08.500
Make one wrong move and I'll punish you.

16:08.500 --> 16:09.360
Understood.

16:09.730 --> 16:14.920
You angels there. How many times 
have you caused Japan trouble already?

16:15.470 --> 16:17.800
Bothering me is one thing,

16:18.360 --> 16:24.370
but didn't your mother teach you not to 
cause trouble for the people around you?

16:25.620 --> 16:27.360
Demon King Satan.

16:27.360 --> 16:28.380
Yeah, what?

16:28.380 --> 16:30.350
Demon King Satan.

16:30.350 --> 16:33.570
Satan. Satan. Satan. Satan!

16:31.880 --> 16:33.570
You're creeping me out.

16:33.570 --> 16:35.970
Satan. Satan. Satan. Satan!

16:35.970 --> 16:38.210
Satan. Satan. Satan. Satan!

16:38.210 --> 16:41.140
Satan! Satan! Satan! Satan!

16:43.800 --> 16:47.900
Wow, no wonder everybody 
loses against sacred swords!

16:50.400 --> 16:54.650
Satan! Satan! Satan! Satan!

16:55.900 --> 16:59.160
Apparently weapons can be <i>too</i> effective!

16:59.160 --> 17:00.910
Acieth, release!

17:00.910 --> 17:02.790
Roger that, Maou!

17:04.310 --> 17:06.420
She's like Alas Ramus?

17:07.330 --> 17:08.880
Satan!

17:17.760 --> 17:19.800
You all right, Chamuel?

17:21.390 --> 17:22.810
Oh, dear.

17:22.810 --> 17:24.380
Gabriel!

17:24.380 --> 17:25.560
Stop, Acieth!

17:25.560 --> 17:30.570
Acieth? Sheesh, it's just one freak
coincidence after another here.

17:27.210 --> 17:29.070
Lemme go!

17:30.890 --> 17:33.480
You've been sneaking around again?

17:33.480 --> 17:35.550
I mean, I guess so?

17:36.570 --> 17:38.560
Time to go, Chamuel.

17:38.560 --> 17:41.880
I get being greedy, but everything'll get
 complicated if you push it now.

17:43.870 --> 17:47.230
Oh, wow, you're in an absolute state.

17:47.230 --> 17:48.980
Come on, Chamuel, hurry.

17:48.980 --> 17:51.710
Neither of you can fight 
at full power here anyway.

17:51.710 --> 17:53.840
I just met someone we don't want to mess with.

17:53.840 --> 17:57.240
Hey. You're gonna go home 
with no explanation?

17:57.240 --> 17:58.090
Hmm?

17:58.670 --> 18:03.620
The NEET crashed out over there 
has my number, so call me later.

18:04.100 --> 18:06.250
And here's something as an apology.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.300
I undid the storm damage

18:12.300 --> 18:17.280
and erased an hour of memory from 
the people trapped in the school.

18:17.770 --> 18:19.610
So let us off the hook for now.

18:19.610 --> 18:23.090
"For now" tells me there'll 
be a rematch in our future.

18:23.090 --> 18:24.620
If you'd like one.

18:25.110 --> 18:29.370
I'd prefer to pass, but I get 
the feeling I'll have no choice.

18:29.370 --> 18:31.330
Glad to hear it.

18:31.750 --> 18:35.380
We do have Emilia the Hero 
in our custody, after all.

18:36.710 --> 18:41.140
Let's meet again, O Demon King 
Satan... O new calamity.

18:43.810 --> 18:45.240
Asshole.

18:46.730 --> 18:50.010
He oughta pay for my re-retest.

18:54.210 --> 18:55.900
Ah, they're back.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.310
Hey!

19:00.510 --> 19:02.410
Ashiya got kidnapped?!

19:02.840 --> 19:04.030
No way.

19:05.350 --> 19:07.160
And Dad, too?

19:07.570 --> 19:11.170
Yeah. By a tall, glib guy 
calling himself Gabriel.

19:11.170 --> 19:13.720
Said he was "putting them 
back where they belong."

19:14.670 --> 19:17.370
So, do you know that creep?

19:17.370 --> 19:21.620
Yes. But I don't know 
why he kidnapped Ashiya.

19:21.620 --> 19:24.510
Ashiya left you a message, actually.

19:24.950 --> 19:28.860
He's waiting for you at "The Gates 
of Hell" in the Ueno art museum.

19:28.860 --> 19:32.690
Aw, that's a scary name! 
Do we have to go there?

19:33.340 --> 19:37.490
Ashiya's visited that museum 
a lot for his research.

19:39.170 --> 19:41.700
Hey! Don't touch our stuff!

19:46.110 --> 19:47.580
Does it hurt?

19:47.580 --> 19:51.210
No, I'm fine. You're too kind, good Chiho.

19:51.530 --> 19:56.380
Don't say that. It's my fault 
that this happened to you.

19:56.380 --> 19:57.210
Plus...

19:59.210 --> 20:03.470
I was happy. Back there...

20:04.040 --> 20:08.690
And my comrades aren't so weak that 
they'd let themselves be too late.

20:09.340 --> 20:12.150
...you called Mister Maou and 
the others your comrades.

20:12.150 --> 20:13.200
I...

20:13.200 --> 20:15.450
That's it! I get it!

20:16.970 --> 20:18.110
Hey, Suzuno!

20:19.230 --> 20:21.360
W-Wait! Not right now!

20:28.460 --> 20:32.310
You were telling the truth when you said we 
could open a Gate with an amplifier, right?

20:32.310 --> 20:33.370
Yes.

20:34.870 --> 20:36.280
Well, we have one.

20:36.280 --> 20:37.500
Where?

20:38.210 --> 20:40.230
Ashiya was looking into it.

20:40.230 --> 20:43.760
The amplifier is "The Gates of Hell." 
It's in an Ueno art museum.

20:45.210 --> 20:48.140
That may be worth trying.

20:48.510 --> 20:49.460
Yeah.

20:50.370 --> 20:54.570
We're gonna go rescue Alas Ramus, 
Nord, Ashiya... and Emi.

20:55.740 --> 20:59.030
Ugh, I gotta get someone to cover my shifts!

20:59.030 --> 21:03.650
And I can't do this by myself. 
I need you guys to help.

21:04.110 --> 21:05.910
I'll help, too!

21:07.020 --> 21:10.370
Excuse me! Who is this girl?!

22:48.770 --> 22:53.330
Alas Ramus, be careful 
or you'll fall off the bed again.

22:53.330 --> 22:54.340
'Kay.

22:54.340 --> 22:58.950
Chiho, Bel... I'm sorry I broke my promise.

22:58.950 --> 23:01.990
It's okay! Papa's coming!

23:01.990 --> 23:03.550
Alas Ramus...

23:06.010 --> 23:06.900
Come in.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.360
What do you want, Olba?

23:10.360 --> 23:15.160
I'm told that your father 
has just arrived at Heavensky.

23:16.090 --> 23:18.380
The stage will soon be set.

23:18.380 --> 23:22.070
I ask you to rest and build up 
your strength until then.

23:23.170 --> 23:29.420
If you do as I say, Emilia, 
I'll do you no harm.

23:32.140 --> 23:33.380
Mama...

23:36.840 --> 23:38.120
Help me.
